cy or stored-value cards since these are harder to trace; making the crime more difficult to prosecute. Sometimes the original files can be retrieved without paying the ransom due to implementation mistakes, leaked cryptographic keys or a complete lack of encryption in the ransomware.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ransomware","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"places":[],"arc":null}}